[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \frac{9}{s} + \frac{t}{60} = 4 \implies \frac{t}{60} = 4 - \frac{9}{s} \implies t = 60 \left(4 - \frac{9}{s}\right) = 240 - \frac{540}{s}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Substitute \( t \) into the second equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} + \frac{240 - \frac{540}{s}}{60} = 2.4
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \frac{9}{s + 2} + 4 - \frac{9}{s} = 2.4 \implies \frac{9}{s + 2} - \frac{9}{s} = -1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Factor out 9:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m 9 \left(\frac{1}{s + 2} - \frac{1}{s}\right) = -1.6 \implies 9 \left(\frac{-2}{s(s + 2)}\right) = -1.6 \implies \frac{-18}{s(s + 2)} = -1.6
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Simplify:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = 1.6 \implies \frac{18}{s(s + 2)} = \frac{8}{5} \implies 90 = 8s^2 + 16s \implies 8s^2 + 16s - 90 = 0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Solve the quadratic equation:
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m 4s^2 + 8s - 45 = 0 \implies s = \frac{-8 + 28}{8} = 2.5
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m Find \( t \):
[36m(TaskRunner pid=191960)[0m \[
